      "writtenOn": "2023-01-23T17:57:31Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "`Build.isDebuggable()` is based on `ro.debuggable` which can be true for `user` builds when flashing with \"force debuggable\". The selinux rules are based on the build type, and do not allow `user` builds, even if debuggable.\n\nI\u0027ll change it to `type !\u003d \"user\"` to better match the bpfloader logic.",
      "parentUuid": "3455cfd3_3df5154c",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 51,
        "startChar": 38,
